WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Launch tutorial: Get a ready campaign out, on your terms.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.600
Page 1 of 2: Audience Builder. Prepare who your ads are for.

3
00:00:06.601 --> 00:00:08.122
Audience Builder is where you prepare who your ads are for.

4
00:00:08.122 --> 00:00:11.904
Ask for suggestions based on your business and research, or create an audience yourself.

5
00:00:11.904 --> 00:00:13.937
Each audience has an age range, countries and interests, plus the platforms where you can reach it.

6
00:00:13.937 --> 00:00:16.908
Targeting recommendations translate it into each platform’s own settings.

7
00:00:16.908 --> 00:00:20.573
Audiences are prepared in OrivenAI and created on a platform only when you publish a campaign with them.

8
00:00:20.573 --> 00:00:23.173
Page 2 of 2: Ad Studio. Check each draft and publish when you choose.

9
00:00:25.771 --> 00:00:31.675
Ad Studio lists your campaign drafts by platform and status.

10
00:00:31.675 --> 00:00:43.475
Open a draft to see its readiness check: every item the platform needs, checked before launch.

11
00:00:43.475 --> 00:00:47.975
Publishing is always your decision, and campaigns start paused in your own ad account.
